#: model_terms:ir.actions.act_window,help:approval_sale.action_approval_category_sale
msgid ""
"Define approval workflows for sale orders: <br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Flow 1: Mixin\n"
"                    Flow (SO → Approval)</strong><br> • Set Approval Type = \"Sale\"<br> • Leave\n"
"                Target Model empty<br> • Configure approval triggers (amount, customer, etc.)<br>\n"
"                • SOs trigger approval automatically based on rules <br><br>\n"
"                <strong>Flow 2:\n"
"                Creation Flow (Approval → SO)</strong><br> • Set Approval Type = \"Sale\"<br> •\n"
"                Set Target Model = \"Sale Order\"<br> • Set \"Has Product\" = Required<br> •\n"
"                Approval creates SO when approved"
