"If checked, this category only applies when creating this SO would cause the customer's receivable balance to exceed their credit limit. Use this to control customer credit exposure.\n"
"\n"
"Superseded once `account_credit` is installed: it clears this flag on every category in its pre_init_hook and hides this field on the form, so credit-driven approval is owned by its credit policy from then on. The flag stays writable through the ORM and the trigger still works if you set it, but nothing in the interface will."
